{
	"$doc": "Single source of truth for every colour, font, radius and shadow (web + mobile). Edit here, then `bun run theme:build`. `highlight` is the overlay ink for hover/sheen tints (white on dark themes, black on light ones); `paper` is a fixed white for surfaces that must stay white (QR codes, PDF pages). `primitives` are raw values; each theme maps semantic tokens onto them with {primitive} refs. Emitted as --vp-<token> CSS variables (src/theme/tokens.css), a JS object (src/theme/tokens.js) and the mobile palette (mobile/src/theme/tokens.js).",
